* Total Back Pain NRS;
* Function (the Bath Ankylosing Spondylitis Functional Index \[BASFI\] score NRS);
* Inflammation (mean of Bath Ankylosing Spondylitis Disease Activity Index \[BASDAI\] NRS Questions #5 and #6 for morning stiffness).

